\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Causal pipeline of the model. Local weather $W$ and crew fatigue $F$ jointly set the collision-warning success probability $P_{\text  {comms}}$ (Eq.~\ref {eq:pcomms}); a delivered warning yields a give-way manoeuvre, a lost warning leaves the encounter to geometry and may produce a hard collision. Collision consequences are evaluated by the SIMCOL damage model, and a foundering vessel enters the search-and-rescue chain.}}{2}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
